      "source_lines": {
        "51": "variety $X_B=G/B$ is the variety of complete flags",
        "52": "$0\\subsetneq L\\subsetneq H\\subsetneq\\mathbb C^3$, and the two minimal-parabolic",
        "53": "projections of [[thm-minimal-parabolic-flag-projection-is-p1-bundle]]",
        "54": "$$f_{\\alpha_1},f_{\\alpha_2}:X_B\\longrightarrow G/P_{\\alpha_1},\\,G/P_{\\alpha_2}$$",
        "55": "are, in the order fixed below, the maps forgetting the line $L$ and forgetting",
        "56": "the plane $H$; each of the two has fibre $\\mathbb P^1$. For the associated line",
        "57": "bundles $\\mathcal L_{\\omega_i}$ of [[def-borel-character-equivariant-line-bundle]]",
        "58": "the degree on the fibre of $f_{\\alpha_j}$ is",
        "59": "$\\langle\\omega_i,\\alpha_j^\\vee\\rangle=\\delta_{ij}$, so that the fibre-degree",
        "60": "pairs of $\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}$ and $\\mathcal L_{\\omega_2}$ are $(1,0)$ and",
        "61": "$(0,1)$; consequently $\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\\otimes\\mathcal L_{\\omega_2}\\cong\\mathcal L_\\rho$"
      },
